# ============================================================
# VERIFICATION DATA
# ============================================================
#
# IMPORTANT — how this section actually works:
#
# There is deliberately NO blanket "data/verification/" ignore
# anywhere in this file. Git cannot un-ignore files inside a
# directory that is itself ignored (the earlier version of this
# file had exactly that bug on the old "data/verification/" line,
# which silently swallowed every exception below it — including
# ones meant to share chip images and reports). Instead, this
# section ignores only the specific heavy/raw file types, by
# pattern, wherever they appear under data/verification/. Small,
# reviewable outputs (CSVs, rendered PNG/JPG previews, HTML
# reports) are never matched by an ignore rule in the first place,
# so there is nothing to "un-ignore" for them.

# Raw multi-band satellite rasters — large, binary, regenerable
# from the CDSE API. Not needed for review; NDVI/NBR/NDBI are
# already extracted into satellite_indices_v*.csv.
data/verification/**/*.tif
data/verification/**/*.tiff
data/verification/**/*.TIF
data/verification/**/*.TIFF
data/verification/**/*.jp2
data/verification/**/*.img
data/verification/**/*.vrt
data/verification/**/*.aux.xml

# Each reviewer's personal working copy of the review UI's local
# output — not the shared candidate/label files, and not meant to
# be merged between collaborators automatically.
data/verification/verification_review_v2*.csv

# Same rules for a local backup copy of the verification tree,
# if one exists.
data/verification-backup/**/*.tif
data/verification-backup/**/*.tiff
data/verification-backup/**/*.TIF
data/verification-backup/**/*.TIFF
data/verification-backup/**/*.jp2
data/verification-backup/**/*.img
data/verification-backup/**/*.vrt
data/verification-backup/verification_review_v2*.csv

# All CSVs under data/verification/ are tracked automatically
# (nothing above matches *.csv), in particular:
#   - verification_candidates_v*.csv        (candidate selection, OSM-enriched versions)
#   - satellite/satellite_indices_v*.csv    (NDVI / NBR / dNBR / NDBI stats)
#   - verification_review_v1.csv            (the original template, not a personal copy)
#   - any *_report*.csv                     (OSM / verification review reports)


# ============================================================
# GENERATED IMAGERY — ANYWHERE IN PROJECT
# ============================================================
#
# Rendered RGB preview chips (PNG/JPG) are the one exception: they
# are the visual evidence reviewers (and Claude) actually look at,
# so they are explicitly un-ignored below. Everything else image-
# shaped stays ignored repo-wide, including raw rasters.

*.tif
*.tiff
*.jp2
*.img
*.vrt
*.bmp
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp

# Un-ignore just the rendered preview chips. This works because no
# parent directory above is ignored as a whole — only specific file
# types are — so git can actually see these paths to re-include them.
!data/verification/**/*.png
!data/verification/**/*.jpg
!data/verification/**/*.jpeg
!data/verification/**/*.webp
!data/verification-backup/**/*.png
!data/verification-backup/**/*.jpg
!data/verification-backup/**/*.jpeg
!data/verification-backup/**/*.webp

# But raw rasters under data/verification/ should stay ignored even
# though the broader PNG/JPG negation above sits nearby — these
# patterns were already excluded earlier by extension, so no
# further action is needed for .tif/.tiff/.jp2/.img/.vrt.


# ============================================================
# GIS / SATELLITE AUXILIARY FILES
# ============================================================

*.ovr
*.tfw
*.jgw
*.pgw
*.prj


